{"data":{"body":"**P1:** The parent\u2019s `STARTED` operation and checkpoint idempotency record are persisted before this in-memory notification runs. A crash or scheduling error in that gap leaves the invoke permanently started without creating either an invocation or child; retrying the checkpoint returns the cached result and does not re-emit the effect. Persist an outbox/dispatch record and reconcile it on startup, or otherwise make dispatch durably redrivable and idempotent before acknowledging the checkpoint.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7weBFE","finding_digest":"471da4bccee8997af1d26a3ea0b813cfe2675bf59ebff1bfd35f636c783dee9e","finding_id":"arf_v1_i4o2jpgo5cmxv4osni7kboatz7","finding_key":"testing/checkpoint/processors/invoke.py::process::dispatch-effect-not-recoverable","identity_key":"testing/checkpoint/processors/invoke.py::process::dispatch-effect-not-recoverable","line":108,"observation_digest":"9b4717b73f4cb5c91c7b4ab31a141630e7a6dcdfa0bc866e0ea28419616f633a","observation_id":"aro_v1_tndrpnz7js24shd3jkzrufawgd","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/checkpoint/processors/invoke.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-17T07:48:32Z","review_id":"arr_v1_fexa7eex3s5pa626mf73sbzagk","reviewed_base_sha":"cf4d27f59c2bf14f87c3ef75f58fc0881b2e2c34","reviewed_head_sha":"3b1594315ff858b6f0d9deec1b556bae3ebdaef9","reviewer":"codex","start_line":108,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":731},"record_id":"art_v1_s2q4fqs2z4zino7ljladxn3lh6","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-17T07:48:32Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
